# onnxruntime-node (pulled in by kokoro-js -> @huggingface/transformers) downloads
# GPU (CUDA) binaries from GitHub on every Linux x64 install. We never use them:
# the speech runs in the browser on onnxruntime-web, and the Node build isn't in
# the bundle. Microsoft has removed the v1.21.0 GPU download, so without this the
# install fails outright (CI, the Docker image, and any Linux self-host build).
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
